roles=[bi('同期歩行のparityをcone複体・配置排除と結び、非零係数とtorsion-free性を別々に保証する独立構成。','An independent construction combining simultaneous-walk parity with cone complexes and arrangement exclusion, separately securing a nonzero coefficient and torsion-freeness.'),bi('穴あき有限幾何のpairing→埋込み→character packing→scalar化。行列式論文に使われる標数2入力を供給。','Punctured finite-geometry pairings, embeddings, character packing, and scalarization; supplies the characteristic-two input used by the determinant paper.'),bi('第2論文のscalar欠損→二進因子分解と実trace差→mod 2^k持上げ→整数行列の行列式。','Turns paper 2’s scalar defect into a binary factorization/real-trace gap, lifts modulo 2^k, and calculates an integral-matrix determinant.'),bi('高次数modular表現の冪等元→共通central sector→向き付き三角圧縮→有限群因子でscalar化。標数2論文への依存なし。','High-degree modular idempotents, a common central sector, directed triangular compression, and finite-factor scalarization; does not depend on the characteristic-two paper.')]
